#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Franziska is a maverick entrepreneur, renowned communication specialist, award-winning international keynote speaker, mad adventurer, bestselling author and the founder of Basic Bananas, Oceanlovers and Moments of Humanity.<\/p>\n<p>Combining strategy, science, innovation and psychology, Franziska\u2019s work has helped thousands of individuals and companies across the globe to improve their communication, spark creativity and tap into courage.<\/p>\n<p>Often rated as the #1 female speaker and referred to as one the smartest women in the entrepreneurial space, Franziska was awarded the NSW Young Entrepreneur of the Year Award in 2013.<\/p>\n<p>Franziska\u2019s down-to-earth approach is like a breath of fresh air. She\u2019s quick at winning over the hearts and minds of her audiences through her boundless energy, realness, deep insights and playful approach.<\/p>\n<p>A Swiss born Australian (or Swaussie) with a sharp-witted humour and an amazing ability to keep her audience members at the edge of their seats, her authentic style leaves everyone engaged, inspired and motivated.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_button button_url=&#8221;@ET-DC@eyJkeW5hbWljIjp0cnVlLCJjb250ZW50IjoicG9zdF9saW5rX3VybF9wYWdlIiwic2V0dGluZ3MiOnsicG9zdF9pZCI6IjI0In19@&#8221; button_text=&#8221;More about Franziska&#8221; button_alignment_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; button_alignment_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; button_alignment_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.2&#8243; _dynamic_attributes=&#8221;button_url&#8221; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;20px||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_button][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;80px|||30px|false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_margin_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; custom_margin_phone=&#8221;-134px||||false|false&#8221; custom_margin_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; text_font_size_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_font_size_phone=&#8221;14px&#8221; text_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; text_orientation_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_orientation_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; text_orientation_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>With a wealth of experiences to draw from, Franziska is known for her generosity and breaking the complex down into practical lessons.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you are looking for a keynote speaker, emcee or panelist, Franziska brings a vibrant, joyful and sassy difference to any event your audiences will connect with and appreciate.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font_size_tablet=&#8221;&#8221; text_font_size_phone=&#8221;14px&#8221; text_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>International keynote speaker<\/li>\n<li>4 x Best-Selling Author<\/li>\n<li>Communication specialist and advisor to some of the world\u2019s leading companies<\/li>\n<li>Regional APAC Communication Expert for Entrepreneurs Organization<\/li>\n<li>Mentor and investor at the Founder Institute<\/li>\n<li>Winner of the Young Entrepreneurs Award<\/li>\n<li>Eternal Optimist and Visionary<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#5ba199&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;11px||11px||true|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; width=&#8221;100%&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px||3px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][e