ck; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> I wasn&#8217;t sure what to expect in Franziska&#8217;s Courage Map workshop. As a business owner, I&#8217;ve read a lot about courage, risk, and overcoming fear and doubt. Franziska not only shared a different perspective but her life experiences, which transformed these concepts into actions I could take away and start to apply. I loved her storytelling and I took copious notes on the different topics. Many in the room were taking notes and snapping pictures of the slides. I would highly recommend Franziska to any organisation and event organiser.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Sheryle Gillihan, CEO, CauseLabs<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> I loved Franziska&#8217;s talk on courage and resilience at the EO Global Leadership conference. She&#8217;s so humble and strong at the same time. She takes her audience with her on her extraordinary journey packed with major life topics and value for the entire crowd.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Frido van Mossel, founder of Amsterdam Heritage<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> Franziska&#8217;s story is inspirational. As a leader and long-time member of EO, I found her journey uniquely invigorating. Listening to her, I felt a renewed sense of energy and determination to break boundaries. It&#8217;s rare to find a story that genuinely ignites your passion, and Franziska&#8217;s message is a testament to her incredible zest for life. Her enthusiasm was contagious, filling the room with a vibrant energy that motivated all of us, an already accomplished group of leaders, to push beyond our limits and explore new horizons. She doesn&#8217;t just tell her story; she lives it with a passion that is truly illuminating.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Liza Roeser, The Flower CEO at FiftyFlowers.com<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> I had the most amazing opportunity to meet Franziska in Seoul at the EO Women\u2019s Summit. As soon as I heard her speak I was completely immersed in her story. She took us with her on her journey in the most natural and honest way. We laughed and learned and worked, all at the same time. It was an incredible learning experience. I would love to see her speak again. Thank you for sharing so much of you with us Franziska.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Christianne Steiner, Founder of DISCOVERme<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> I loved Franziska\u2019s talk on courage and resilience at the EO Global Leadership conference. She\u2019s so humble and strong at the same time. She takes her audience with her on her extraordinary journey packed with major life topics and value for the entire crowd.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Frido van Mossel, founder, Amsterdam Heritage<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> Franziska continuously ranks amongst the Branding, Design, and Entrepreneurship mentors with the highest ratings from Founder Institute Australia and New Zealand founders. Our startup founders love her hands-on experience of launching brands, products, services, and organisations.  We highly recommend her for anything communication, marketing rand brand strategy related.  &#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22> Paul Krajewski &#8211; Co-Director Founder Institute<\/h4>\n<p>&#8221; content_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.22.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;17px&#8221; title_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/wdcl_image_carousel_child][wdcl_image_carousel_child photo=&#8221;https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Capture.jpg&#8221; title=&#8221;<img src=%22https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/unnamed-file.png%22 width=%2279%22 height=%2267%22 alt=%22%22 class=%22wp-image-69 alignnone size-full%22 style=%22margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;%22 \/> Franziska was a fabulous addition to our Strategic Entrepreneur conference. She is relevant. She is funny. She had tremendous positive energy. But most of all, she had easy to apply communication and marketing wisdom that really helped the +500 entrepreneurs in the room. I\u2019d recommend any SME conference organizer to hire her, our audience loved her.&#8221; sub_title=&#8221;<\/p>\n<h4 style=%22margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300;%22>Siimon Reynolds, CEO, The Fortun